Chapter: LinearErrors
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Combined linear error checks: use-after-consume (2061 x2),
 linear-unused (2063).

Section: Definitions

  use-twice : linear Integer -> Integer
  use-twice (n) = n + n

  freeze-then-use : linear Integer -> Integer
  freeze-then-use (n) = freeze n + n

  drop-linear : linear Integer -> Integer
  drop-linear (n) = 99

  opening : Integer = use-twice 1

